#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1359
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainTowerRules"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER is a facility where\n"
"four types of battles are waged--\l"
"SINGLE BATTLE, DOUBLE BATTLE, MULTI\l"
"BATTLE, and LINK MULTI BATTLE.\p"
